        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Keller\n- Companies: AMD, Apple, Samsung\n- Products: Apple A4\n- Concepts: package-on-package (PoP), system-on-a-chip (SoC)\n\nFacts:\n- Beginning in 1997, Samsung manufactured the Apple A4 package-on-package system-on-a-chip designed by Apple Inc.\n- Jim Keller is a microprocessor engineer best known for his work at AMD and Apple.\n- Jim Keller was involved in designing the Apple A4 package-on-package system-on-a-chip.",
