        "original_id": "b3821fe5-23c7-5afd-b899-2c1c8c797f2e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jim Keller\n- Companies: AMD, Apple Inc., Samsung\n- Products: AMD K8 microarchitecture, Athlon 64, Athlon (K7), Apple A4, Apple A5\n- Concepts: 32-bit, package on package (PoP), system-on-a-chip (SoC)\n\nFacts:\n- Jim Keller was involved in designing the Athlon (K7) processors.\n- Jim Keller was the lead architect of the AMD K8 microarchitecture, including the original Athlon 64.\n- Jim Keller was involved in designing the Apple A4 and Apple A5 processors.\n- The Apple A4 is a 32-bit package on package system-on-a-chip designed by Apple Inc.\n- Samsung manufactured the Apple A4.",
